  "scope_lock": {
    "source": "Polished version of the first Vertical MVP slice (place_value_bridge): assets, animation, business logic and functionalities fully completed. Generate assets with gpt-image-2, animate with GSAP, stay aligned with the approved MathQuest: Star Trail art direction (json/ guidance + assets/references/).",
    "in_scope": [
      "Project scaffolding: Vanilla JS + Vite + GSAP",
      "Asset generation pipeline via gpt-image-2 for layered sprites and backgrounds (map, lesson, reward)",
      "9-state game state machine: boot -> adventure_map -> node_26_selected -> lesson_question -> answer_selected -> feedback -> reward_completion -> save_progress -> return_to_map",
      "Adventure Map scene: 7 nodes (21-25 completed, 26 active, 27 locked), top counters (Level 12 / 152 stars / 7 streak), 3 bottom nav destinations, active-node pulse glow, node-select animation",
      "Lesson scene: Place Value question (400+30+6), 4 answer tiles, progress 4/10, hearts 2 filled 1 empty, Hint/Help/Read support controls, correct/incorrect feedback animations",
      "Reward scene: Bridge Repaired banner drop, three-star pop, +60 XP count-up, Continue Adventure + Back to Map CTAs",
      "Scoring engine: first_try/after_hint/after_one_incorrect/after_multiple_incorrect -> stars + score, completion_xp=60",
      "Progress persistence (localStorage) so node 27 unlocks after node 26 reward",
      "GSAP animation timelines for every animation cue in the config, with reduced-motion fallback",
      "Accessibility: Hint/Help/Read controls present and operable, keyboard + ARIA on interactive elements",
      "Final integration scene-router wiring all scenes reachable from a single entrypoint"
    ],
    "out_of_scope": [
      "Lessons or nodes other than node 26 / place_value_400_30_6",
      "Real backend, user accounts, networking, or cloud save",
      "Audio playback engine beyond stubbed Read/Help control hooks",
      "Shop, Practice, Quests destination content (nav present but non-functional placeholders)",
      "Worlds beyond Star Trail / Number Meadow regions visible in the slice",
      "Monetization, ads, analytics",
      "Multi-question banks or adaptive difficulty"
    ],
    "expansion_policy": "requires-user-approval"
  },
